==Battleground==
*1 [[Large Iron Ball]] (100%) spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Large Iron Ball]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Large Iron Ball]]s (100%) spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Large Iron Ball]]s (100%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] or [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|Rusher Cats]] such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] can easily beat the stage.

